                                "sense_id": "187b477a-eedb-37e0-9616-577c24dafaf2",
                                "text": "The Charioteer rides afore, a-ſtraddle on the Beam that makes the Yoke for the Oxen, which is covered with Scarlet, and finely carved underneath […]"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "2838eeaa-cf1a-4498-b4a7-7ef1302b12ac",
                                "sense_id": "187b477a-eedb-37e0-9616-577c24dafaf2",
                                "text": "A faint string of smoke was rising from a cigarette-tray—a number of Vanity Fair sat astraddle on the table."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "4fc929d0-7925-44fe-9da3-6abb7307469c",
                                "sense_id": "187b477a-eedb-37e0-9616-577c24dafaf2",
                                "text": "She climbed his body and wrapped her legs around him and they made love there, man standing, woman astraddle, in the stone odor of demolition."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
